OL,3,GNEWSAFour people die in Bootle house
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have died in a house fire
OL,7,Fin Bootle, Merseyside Fire and Rescue
OL,8,FService have said.
OL,10,FChief fire officer Nick Searle said
OL,11,Fanother person had been taken to
OL,12,Fhospital following the "intense fire
OL,13,Fwhich spread very rapidly" in Stone
OL,14,FSquare at 03:45 BST.
OL,16,FThe street was cordoned off by police
OL,17,Fand fire officers could be seen
OL,18,Fknocking on the doors of neighbouring
OL,19,Fhomes.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
