OL,3,GNEWSAFour people die in Bootle house
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne neighbour said: "I heard shouting
OL,7,Fin the early hours but I just thought
OL,8,Fsomeone was having an argument, then I
OL,9,Fcame downstairs and saw all the fire
OL,10,Fengines."
